karma provides CMake targets:

  find_package(karma CONFIG REQUIRED)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE karma::server)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE karma::headless)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE karma::graphical)

This overlay port packages the server, headless, and graphical profiles from
the local checkout. The graphical feature depends on the local diligentcore
overlay port.
